== 6. Finding that needs the project owner ==
v2 shows no trace of the on-device tests of Phase 1-2: no user other than the two smoke users,
no object in the avatars bucket, profile A has no avatar or bio, and the only sessions are one
browser (email confirmation, 2026-11-13 16:41) and the node smoke runs. Signing out deletes a
session, so this is not proof, but if the phone signed up or changed an avatar, it was not on v2.
The repo's app/.env and bundle point to v2, so a device test against another database would come
from another copy of the app (for example the v1 project, which used the old ref).

== 7. Guards added (branch phase-3/3.1b-pin-v2) ==
scripts/lib/v2.mjs      single source of the v2 ref
scripts/live_*.mjs      refuse any URL other than v2; a clear message for the old ref (exit 2, before network)
scripts/sb.mjs          npm run db:push / db:list / db:advisors always add --linked --project-ref v2
scripts/db_verify.mjs   npm run db:verify: repo migrations vs live v2 schema
app/src/lib/env.ts      the app refuses the old project URL (configuration error screen)
